capability caching  `ttlMs` and `cacheScope` on discovery, the lists and a read; none on a retry's result
  heroes  mcp.Server, mcp.answer_resource
  go      go-sdk mcp.Cacheable, mcp.CacheableResult
  rust    -
  python  mcp.server.CacheHint, mcp.server.caching, mcp.client.CacheConfig, CacheEntry, CacheKey, CacheMode, InMemoryResponseCacheStore, ResponseCacheStore, caching
  note    The server writes the hints; a client cache is the program's, the hints read from the results

capability mrtr/elicitation  a server that needs the user answers `input_required` with an elicitation, form or URL; a client answers and retries; the capability checked first (-32021)
  heroes  mcp.InputRequest, mcp.InputRequired, mcp.Inputs, mcp.Elicited, mcp.no_inputs, mcp.inputs_of, mcp.elicited_of, mcp.elicitation_response, mcp.answer_input_required, mcp.input_request_json, mcp.input_request_of, mcp.input_required_json, mcp.input_required_of
  go      go-sdk mcp.ElicitParams, mcp.ElicitResult, mcp.InputRequest, mcp.InputRequestMap, mcp.InputResponse, mcp.InputResponseMap, mcp-go server.ElicitationResponse, server.InputResponse, server.InputRequestBuilder, client.ElicitationHandler, client.WithElicitationHandler, client.WithMaxInputRoundTrips, client.WithManualInputRoundTrips
  rust    -
  python  mcp.InputRequiredRoundsExceededError, mcp.UrlElicitationRequiredError, mcp.server.elicitation, mcp.client.Client.elicitation_callback, input_required_max_rounds
  note    A client retries by hand, as mcp-go's manual mode: the language has no callback that could hold the user's answer

capability mrtr/state  a server's `requestState` signed and bound to its request and its end, refused when changed
  heroes  mcp.sign_state, mcp.verify_state
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  mcp.server.request_state
  note    It is `web.sign_value`'s HMAC-SHA256, bound to what the program names: the method, the tool and the user, as the revision advises

capability progress  a request's progress told against its token, only where it asked
  heroes  mcp.progress_notification
  go      go-sdk mcp.ProgressNotificationParams, mcp-go mcp.ProgressNotification
  rust    -
