capability transport/streamable-http  one POST a message, JSON or an event stream answered, 202 for a notification, 405 for GET and DELETE, the Origin checked, the mirrored fields checked against the body (-32020), sessions and resumption passed over
  heroes  mcp.read_http, mcp.respond_http, mcp.start_stream, mcp.write_event, mcp.http_client, mcp.send_request
  go      go-sdk mcp.StreamableHTTPHandler, mcp.StreamableClientTransport, mcp.StreamableServerTransport, mcp.DefaultMaxRequestBodyBytes, mcp-go server.NewStreamableHTTPServer, client.NewStreamableHttpClient, server.CORSConfig and its options
  rust    -
  python  mcp.server.streamable_http, mcp.server.streamable_http_manager, mcp.server.transport_security, mcp.client.streamable_http
