capability transport/x-mcp-header  a tool's `x-mcp-header` annotations checked, its arguments mirrored into `Mcp-Param-` fields by a client and held to the body by a server, values in the Base64 sentinel where a field cannot hold them
  heroes  mcp.list_tools
  go      go-sdk the standard headers of `streamable_headers`, mcp-go client.WithInvalidToolHandler
  rust    -
